// The LOD demo, in the app only: a field of smelters in five columns 3 m apart and twenty rows every 4 m to 76 m, each choosing its level of detail by its size on screen (doc/render.md). The levels are the decimation demo's depth 9 Poisson decimations, from 768000 triangles down to 1500.
camera = { target = [0, 1, -6], yaw = 0, pitch = 0.15, distance = 8 }
sun = { direction = [0.4, -1, -0.3], colour = [1, 0.96, 0.9], intensity = 1 }
exposure = 1
ambient = 0.15
